+# N28 independent native parent-wrapper protocol v1
+
+CPU preparation only; runtime authority and execution release are separate root artifacts. One resource process on frozen GPU7, 80 active seconds + 40 cleanup seconds = 120 total process seconds maximum, 0 episodes/model/score/provider/simulator calls. Full process cost goes to the existing health ledger and cumulative 100 GPU hours, recovery GPU-hours category; no episode attempt slot is silently consumed. No retry. The entire local N28 8.25-hour cap includes this proof.
+
+Exactly 24 synthetic cases in fixed order: existing six `qd_ed_n25_reference.CASES` × FP32/BF16 × contiguous/model-slice layouts. Immutable N27 arithmetic proof is a historically accepted reference, not re-executed or renamed. The actual N28 parent mutation wrapper runs once per case on the assigned CUDA backend. Same native tensor/stride enters production clipped geometry, global normalization and feasible-ray assignment. Independent N26 reconstruction and N27 row-wise feasible-ray reference do not invoke the production numerical helper. Compare contiguous uint8 bytes with zero tolerance; preserve native dtype/reduction/layout. No CPU result may stand in for a CUDA proof.
+
+Require exact parent-input/before, projection/origin, raw and normalized gradients, unconstrained operand, assigned after and FP32 alpha. Check untouched full-tensor tail/nontranslation, CPU and assigned CUDA RNG states, strict boundary derivative, legitimate coincident/saturated zero gradients, fixed projector/origin counts, and sample-only/config failures. Finite one-element corruption, wrong source semantics and signed-zero mismatch must reject. Fixed all-zero cases remain valid; no activity threshold.
+
+The synthetic resource reports `boundary_observer_binding_verified` from a direct observer invocation, without running renoise or drawing noise. This is not measured entry into the actual renoise method; that is covered separately by CPU original-method call-chain tests and live worker entry events.
+
+First-guided live evidence contains original N27 initial witness plus ten N28 parent witnesses. A separate bounded boundary event is emitted inside original `_eds_renoise_reference` before the original noise draw, binding identical tensor object/actual passed prefix and original timestep count. Its bytes count toward the same 20 KiB per-call/220 KiB per-episode and combined 16 KiB per-call metadata caps. Independent audit binds parent allocation sequence/source-prefix bytes, witness, origin events and subsequent boundary prefix, without treating a scalar promise as native observation. Source/stub call-chain proof and actual boundary observation are separate from still-Unknown model transfer causality. No extra model/noise/projection/score call is introduced by evidence.
+
+Whole guided chunk: initial4+parent10 RBF, zero post-forward rollout RBF, unchanged21 model batches/176 candidates/11 canonical scoring batches. Native audit runs in the original metered episode worker, including overhead, with original general quality/parent/selection checks retained. Supervisor consumes CPU hashes/JSON only. Any incomplete/failed proof or episode closes the cohort; no loosening tolerance, retries or protected phases.
